config AXS15231B
	bool "AXS15231B QSPI LCD display controller driver"
	depends on SPI
	depends on SPI_EXTENDED_MODES
	help
	  Enable driver for the AXS15231B QSPI LCD controller (e.g. the 3.5"
	  320x480 panel on the Guition JC3248W535 / cobantab1a module). The panel
	  is driven over QSPI: the 32-bit command opcode and parameters are sent in
	  1-wire mode and the pixel data in 4-wire (QIO) mode. SPI_EXTENDED_MODES is
	  required for the 4-wire line mode.
